# Library of Leng and madness (CR 702.35a) both replace a discarded Basking Rootwalla's move to the graveyard, and Bot1,
# whose card it is, chooses which applies first (CR 616.1). Faithless Looting discards two Rootwallas. For the first,
# Bot1 takes madness: it is exiled, the Library no longer applies (it is not going to the graveyard, CR 616.1f), and
# madness's trigger offers the cast, which Bot1 declines, so it goes to the graveyard. For the second, Bot1 takes the
# Library and puts it on top of the library: madness no longer applies, so no madness trigger, and nothing is cast.
[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Jet
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Basking Rootwalla
Basking Rootwalla
